<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Birthday Surprise 💗</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffdce9,#eadcff);display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;padding:20px}.card{width:100%;max-width:500px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);border-radius:30px;padding:30px 22px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}.hearts{font-size:28px;letter-spacing:6px}h1{color:#e65391;font-size:42px}h2{color:#e65391}p{color:#555;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6}button{border:none;background:#ff6f9f;color:white;padding:15px 25px;border-radius:30px;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer;margin-top:12px}#surprise{display:none;margin-top:25px}.gift{font-size:75px}.heart-area{width:260px;height:250px;margin:25px auto;position:relative;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center}.heart-area:before{content:"♥";position:absolute;font-size:270px;color:#ffb2ca;line-height:1;z-index:0}.qr-box{width:180px;height:180px;padding:8px;background:white;border-radius:15px;z-index:2;box-shadow:0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}.qr-box img{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}.scan-text{color:#e65391;font-weight:bold;font-size:20px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
<div class="hearts">💗 💕 💗</div>
<h1>Happy Birthday! 🎂</h1>
<p>Hey You... 💗<br>Tumhare liye ek chhota sa surprise hai... ✨</p>
<button onclick="openSurprise()">🎁 Open Your Surprise</button>
<div id="surprise">
<div class="gift">🎁</div><h2>Surprise! 💝</h2>
<p>Wishing you lots of happiness, smiles and beautiful memories. 🎂✨</p>
<p>Aur ye raha tumhara special QR surprise! 💗</p>
<div class="heart-area"><div class="qr-box"><img src="https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=300x300&data=https%3A%2F%2Frohitrawat456877-svg.github.io%2F-This-is-For-You-%2F" alt="Birthday Surprise QR"></div></div>
<p class="scan-text">❤️ SCAN ME ❤️</p>
<p>Scan this QR code and open the surprise again! 🎉</p>
</div></div>
<script>function openSurprise(){document.getElementById("surprise").style.display="block";}</script>
</body>
</html>h
